{"text": "A fly landed on his shoulder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he hit it with his trunk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You could not do that with your old nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Python. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he picked some grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his trunk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And ate it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the sun was hot. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He put cool mud. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Elephants Child went home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Swinging his new trunk happily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked fruit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Instead of waiting for it to fall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also picked up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All the melon skins. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That he had dropped on the way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he got home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He played some funny tricks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pulled the Ostrichs tail feathers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And blew bubbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into the Hippos ear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon his relatives hurried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the Limpopo. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To get new noses too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And that is why. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every elephant today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Has a long trunk.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "f", "l", "y", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "l", "d", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "i", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "t", "r", "u", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d"